      "content": "# Postmortem: Guest checkout\n\n## Summary\ncheckout-service failed 100% of checkouts after a deploy. War Room identified the regression, deployed a fix from `fix/guest-checkout-null-user` and the error rate fell to 5%.\n\n## Timeline\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:39.654Z: Regression deployed (scenario: Guest checkout)\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:39.655Z: Status DEPLOYING\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:44.859Z: Error-rate alert fired at 100%: TypeError: Cannot read properties of null (reading 'loyaltyTier')\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:44.859Z: Status CRITICAL\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:44.859Z: Status INVESTIGATING\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:45.027Z: Triage started\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:46.309Z: Triage finished\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:46.309Z: Log Detective started\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:47.984Z: Log Detective finished\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:47.984Z: Git Detective started\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:49.285Z: Git Detective finished\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:49.286Z: Status FIXING\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:49.345Z: Fixer started\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:49.986Z: Fixer finished\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:55.715Z: Fix deployed from fix/guest-checkout-null-user by revert; error rate 100% → 5%\n- 2026-10-25T22:17:55.715Z: Status RESOLVED\n\n## Root Cause\nCommit `03c6a9e support guest checkout` introduced a regression in the checkout path (null user dereference).\n\n## Resolution\nThe fix was applied by reverting the guilty commit, redeployed and verified with replayed traffic.\n\n## Action Items\n- Add a regression test covering this failure.\n- Gate deploys on checkout error rate.\n- Require review for changes to the checkout path."
